  "notes": "{千切|ちぎ}る is a godan verb meaning to tear something into pieces by hand.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Transitive (⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧)\n- Pattern: X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{千切|ちぎ}る\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{千切|ちぎ}って⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ can indicate ongoing tearing or the resulting state of having torn something.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦パン→パン：00553_pan⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{千切|ちぎ}る (tear bread)\n- ⟦{紙|かみ}→紙：00712_kami⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{千切|ちぎ}る (tear paper)\n- ⟦{葉|は}→葉：02241_ha⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{千切|ちぎ}る (pick leaves)\n\nRelated expressions:\n- ⟦{千切|ちぎ}れる→千切れる：11941_chigireru⟧ (intransitive: to be torn)\n- {千切|ちぎ}り⟦キャベツ→キャベツ：05187_kyabetsu⟧ (hand-torn cabbage - cooking term)\n\nWRITING:\nOften written in hiragana as ちぎる.",
